.TH EGGHEAD-DOCTOR 1 "April 2026" "egghead 0.1.0" "Egghead Manual"
.SH NAME
egghead-doctor \- diagnose setup problems
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B egghead doctor
.RB [ \-\-config
.IR PATH ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run diagnostic checks on the Egghead installation. Reports pass/fail
status for each component.
.SH CHECKS
.TP
.B Config
Config file exists and is valid YAML.
.TP
.B Records
Records directory is accessible.
.TP
.B Index
SQLite index is present and readable.
.TP
.B NIF
OpenTUI NIF binary exists for this platform.
.TP
.B Port
Web port is available (not bound by another process).
.TP
.B Logs
Log file path is writable.
.TP
.B Providers
Each configured LLM provider is reachable.
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-config \fIPATH\fR
Override config file location.
.TP
.B \-h, \-\-help
Show help text.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR egghead-config (1),
.BR egghead-llm (1),
.BR egghead (1)
